# Makro South Africa
> Makro is one of South Africa's leading wholesale and retail businesses, offering a wide range of products across grocery, household, electronics, liquor, office, outdoor, and business categories through physical stores and online shopping at makro.co.za.

## About Makro
Makro provides consumers and businesses with access to thousands of products across multiple categories, supported by nationwide delivery, click-and-collect services, in-store shopping, and value-driven promotions.

